+ * BeatPulse Synth (#14) | Web Audio Drum Machine & Step Sequencer
+ * Pure synthesis (zero samples): kick/snare/hat/clap + melodic bass/lead
+ * with lookahead scheduler, swing, filters, presets & FFT visualizer.
+ */
+(function () {
